{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Model catalogue. This is DATA, not code \u2014 the provider landscape moves faster",
    "than plugin releases, so nothing here is compiled in. Add rows freely; the",
    "settings UI and the request builder both read this file.",
    "",
    "The load-bearing field is \"sampling\". Claude Opus 5, Sonnet 5, Opus 4.8/4.7",
    "and Fable 5 REJECT temperature/top_p/top_k with a 400. Setting sampling:false",
    "makes the AI-settings panel hide those sliders and makes the request builder",
    "omit the parameters entirely, instead of sending something that errors.",
    "",
    "\"thinking\": adaptive | none",
    "   adaptive -> {\"type\":\"adaptive\"}. budget_tokens is REMOVED on current",
    "   Claude models and returns 400; there is no numeric-budget option here.",
    "",
    "\"effort\": the levels the model accepts inside output_config. Empty = no",
    "   effort control, so the panel hides it.",
    "",
    "\"cacheMinTokens\": prompt-cache minimum. Below this a cache_control marker is",
    "   silently ignored, so we don't bother sending one.",
    "",
    "Prices are USD per million tokens and are used only for the cost estimate.",
    "Verify against the provider's pricing page before trusting them."
  ],
  "providers": [
